Using the vis-viva equation at the point where the speed is reduced to \(0.96v_0\):

\[
v_0^2=\frac{GM}{r}, \qquad v^2=0.96^2\,\frac{GM}{r}
\]

\[
\frac{v^2}{2}-\frac{GM}{r}=-\frac{GM}{2a}
\]

So,

\[
0.96^2\frac{GM}{r}-2\frac{GM}{r}=-\frac{GM}{a}
\]

\[
\frac{1}{a}= \frac{2-0.96^2}{r}
\quad\Rightarrow\quad
a=\frac{r}{2-0.9216}=\frac{r}{1.0784}
\]

\[
\frac{T}{T_0}=\left(\frac{a}{r}\right)^{3/2}
\]

\[
T=7119\left(\frac{1}{1.0784}\right)^{3/2}\approx 6332.60\ \text{s}
\]

